#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:18
msgid "General Information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can limit the search to a select list of countries using the "
"``countries`` parameter. Results outside of those specific countries will"
" never be considered. The geographical area selected by the ``countries``"
" parameter may change depending on the value of the ``political_view`` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:31
msgid "Geocode Queries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:33 casageo.coder.geocode:1 of
msgid "Geocode addresses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can supply either a free-form address string or a combination of "
"country, state, county, city, district, street, house number and postal "
"code. Combining these two approaches is also supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the input data combines street and house number information into a "
"single field, you can pass the resulting string to the ``street`` field "
"and leave the ``housenumber`` field unset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.coder.rst:43
msgid ""
"If you specify a ``position`` for the search, the search will favor "
"places around that position and ``distance`` values will be computed for "
"the results."
msgstr ""

